WEBVTT

00:05:01.195 --> 00:05:04.874
that is: How could I make
the lives of Amina

00:05:04.898 --> 00:05:08.036
and millions of other young girls and boys

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.867
better in our country?

00:05:12.256 --> 00:05:18.090
See, I believe that leadership is about
creating possibilities that everyone,

00:05:18.114 --> 00:05:19.871
especially the young people,

00:05:19.895 --> 00:05:21.748
can believe in,

00:05:21.772 --> 00:05:23.038
own,

00:05:23.062 --> 00:05:24.893
work to actualize,

00:05:24.917 --> 00:05:28.531
and which they can
actively fight to protect.

00:05:29.878 --> 00:05:32.656
The pathway to power and leadership